        {
          "text": "“Mkakumbila nyumba ja mjenu. Mkakumbila ŵakongwe ŵa ajenu, atamose ŵamasengo ŵakwe ŵalume, atamose ŵamasengo ŵakwe ŵakongwe, atamose ng'ombe jakwe, atamose bulu jwakwe kapena cindu cilicose ca mjenu.”",
